### M5. `delivery_service` 用 `personalSessionKey` 记录出站审计,与任务 session 不一致
**文件**: `backend-go/internal/application/delivery_service.go:221`

```go
SessionKey:  personalSessionKey(bot.OwnerID),  // "personal:{owner_id}"
